          "model_output": "To find the measure of $\\alpha$, we need to determine the angle between the lines $pD$ and $pE$.\n\n1. **Identify the angles**:\n   - The angle between $pD$ and $pE$ is $\\alpha$.\n   - The angle between $pA$ and $pB$ is $105^\\circ$.\n   - The angle between $pC$ and $pD$ is $110^\\circ$.\n   - The angle between $pE$ and $pF$ is $110^\\circ$.\n\n2. **Calculate the sum of the angles**:\n   - The sum of the angles is $105^\\circ + 110^\\circ + 110^\\circ = \\boxed{320^\\circ}$.\n\nConclusion:\nThe measure of $\\alpha$, in degrees, is $\\boxed{320^\\circ}$.",
