          "model_output": "To find the maximum of $\\angle APB$, we need to consider the following:\n\n1. **Identify the angles**:\n   - $\\angle APB$ is the angle between the line segment $OP$ and the line segment $AB$.\n   - $\\angle APB$ is the maximum when $OP$ is perpendicular to $AB$.\n\n2. **Calculate $\\angle APB$**:\n   - Since $OP$ is perpendicular to $AB$, $\\angle APB$ is the maximum when $OP$ is at a right angle to $AB$.\n   - Since $OP$ is at a right angle to $AB$, $\\angle APB$ is $\\angle APB = 90^\\circ$.\n\n3. **Conclusion**:\n   - The maximum of $\\angle APB$ is $\\boxed{90^\\circ}$.",
