          "model_output": "To solve this problem, we need to determine the value of $x$ in the equation $x = \\frac{3}{5} \\times 6$.\nWe can set up the equation as follows:\n\\[ x = \\frac{3}{5} \\times 6 \\]\n\\[ x = \\frac{18}{5} \\]\n\\[ x = 3 \\]\n\nNow, we need to find the value of $x$ that satisfies the equation. Since $x$ must be a real number, we can take the positive square root of both sides of the equation:\n\\[ x = 3 \\]\n\nTherefore, Chris is $\\boxed{3}$ years old now.",
