          "unique_id": "test/algebra/346.json",
          "model_output": "To find $g(f(5)-1)$, we need to find the value of $f(5)-1$ and then apply the function $g(x)$ to it.\n\nFirst, we find $f(5)-1$:\n\\[f(5) = 5 + 3 = 8\\]\n\\[f(5)-1 = 8 - 1 = 7\\]\n\nNow, we apply $g(x)$ to $f(5)-1$:\n\\[g(7) = 7 + 1 = 8\\]\n\nTherefore, $g(f(5)-1) = g(7) = 8$.\n\nThe answer is $\\boxed{8}$.",
          "model_answer": "8"
